    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061108.0079\n\nCAIRO, Nov. 8 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nXinhua Middle East news advisory -- Nov. 8\n\n\n\n\nThe following are some of major Mideast news stories due to be covered or pursued by Xinhua News Agency on Wednesday.\n\n-- Monitoring the security situation in Iraq after a genocide trial of ousted President Saddam Hussein resumed.\n\n-- Monitoring the Palestinian-Israeli conflict after an Israeli tank shell killed 18 Palestinians.\n\n-- Monitoring the latest developments of Iran's nuclear file.",
